ned On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 16 19 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast and axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm breast with an attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm axillary tail  The breast is surfaced by a REMOVED_DATE x 11 0cm previously blue dyed tan  irregular skin which has an eccentric 1 5cm inverted nipple  A discrete scar is not evident  The specimen is black inked and serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm well delineated tan white gritty to firm lesion which comes to within 2 0cm of the deep margin  The parenchyma adjacent to the lesion has been previously blue dyed which is contiguous with the blue dye skin  The remaining parenchyma is predominantly yellow lobulated fatty with a minimal dense white fibrous tissue and focal cystic changes  Within the attached axillary tail are multiple tan red rubbery to slightly firm fatty lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 2 8cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted as follows  Section Code  A  Sections of tumor  B  Deep margin  en face  C F  Lesion  G  Tissue away from tumor  H  4 whole lymph nodes  I  3 whole lymph nodes  J  2 whole lymph nodes  K  2 whole lymph nodes  L  2 whole lymph nodes  M  2 whole lymph nodes  N  1 bisected lymph node  O P  1 bisected lymph node  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  ZUOQIN TANG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Danielle G Taghian  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
