  and 3 8cm from the overlying skin ellipse  Section code  A  nearest inked margin of biopsy cavity B E representative sections of biopsy cavity The next biopsy cavity beneath the most lateral scar measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and is hemorrhagic  contains on either side of it areas of firm  white  poorly circumscribed tissue  one measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm and the other measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  The white  firm tissue is 0 5cm from the nearest inked margin  inferior  and 2 5cm from the overlying skin ellipse  Section code  F  mass with nearest inked resection margin  inferior  G J representative sections of biopsy cavity and mass K L M N  representative sections of other fibrous abnormal areas The attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm axillary tail is sectioned to reveal mutliple tan to pink lymph nodes  the largest measuring 2 0cm in greatest dimension  submitted as representative sections in O U  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  PART B  AXILLARY CONTENTS   report_end  , Unchecked.
