ns are submitted as follows  K   tumor to deep margin  L   tumor to inferior medial superficial margin  M N  additional tumor  O   fibrous tissue away from tumor  representing outer quadrants  P   fibrous tissue away from tumor  representing inner quadrants  Q   one half of three lymph nodes  R T  lymph nodes  submitted in toto  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY  Sclerotic breast tissue with minor fibrocystic changes  O R  Resident  NICOLE ANN BELSLEY  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
