ules of tumor are scattered throughout the breast parenchyma  Tumor is grossly present at the deep margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A D  Fibrotic mass to deep resection margin  E F  Skin  G H  Other masses in parenchyma  I J  Skin margins  en face  K  Tumor to skeletal muscle  L  Tumor to deep margin  Also received in this case  is a nonoriented piece of lobulated yellow grossly hemorrhagic adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  The external surface is entirely inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a heterogeneous brown red white ill defined cut surface  A representative section is submitted in cassette K  Resident  JOSHUA B  KISH  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Cameron Dorrans Wright  M D  William Gerald Austen  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
